{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.FluidDynamics.vorticity_lower_bound","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.vorticity_lower_bound","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.vorticity_lower_bound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.vorticity_lower_bound","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/vorticity_lower_bound.lean#L39-L52","doc":"**Content statement** (from manuscript):\n\nLet $v_q$ be the q-NS solution for anti-parallel vortex pair\ninitial data ([counter-example](#conj:ns-counterexample)) and let\n$v^*$ be the weak limit as $q \\to 1$\n([q-Aubin--Lions](#conj:q-aubin-lions)).  Let $\\omega^* = \\nabla\n\\times v^*$ and let $d(t)$ be the separation between the two\nfilament cores.\n\n    The Lean encoding below states the manuscript claim over a context class and discharges it from the class's fields (§3b-conditional). The declaration type-checks as a complete term; the substantive mathematical content is carried by the context-class axioms, and a full derivation from substrate primitives remains pending. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.impl_lower_bound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.impl_lower_bound","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/vorticity_lower_bound.lean#L37-L37","doc":"Manuscript claim — vorticity lower bound near the blowup:\n`|ω*(t, x)| ≥ C / d(t)` along the counter-example trajectory. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.bound_active","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.bound_active","kind":"theorem","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/vorticity_lower_bound.lean#L34-L34","doc":"Hypothesis that the vorticity lower bound is active. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.vorticity_bounded_below","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.vorticity_bounded_below","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/vorticity_lower_bound.lean#L32-L32","doc":"Proposition: the vorticity has a lower bound near the blowup. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.C_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.C_pos","kind":"theorem","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/vorticity_lower_bound.lean#L30-L30","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.C","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.C","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/vorticity_lower_bound.lean#L29-L29","doc":"The lower-bound constant `C : ℝ` (positive). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.d","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.d","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/vorticity_lower_bound.lea